{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Quest is a Semi-Idle RPG game. Players recruit heroes, kill monsters, craft weapons &amp; armor, advance talent trees, enchant/reforge equipment, discover mysterious gems, and finally assemble the most powerful adventure teams!<br><br><strong>Please note before purchase: Idle play is one of the main components of this game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-idle game with deep and complex itemization systems to support endless character builds!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 6 adventurer classes to choose from. Every class has 2 specializations, with 3 spells each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Real-Time battle system: During battles, each unit takes its turn according to its initiative stat. However, triggered effects, buff/debuff ticks, and regeneration happen in &quot;real time&quot;. This unique system allows for deep strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 different active and passive skills to experiment with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant, Reforge, and Transfer systems allow high customization of adventurers\u2019 equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep gem system and a variety of set bonuses to further expand your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of monsters among 6 different maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract residents and conduct explorations to further expand your town!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330930?t=1751647829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330930?t=1751647829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/06d5df0db9a92824bea30d0d3834b62bbbae81e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751647829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/06d5df0db9a92824bea30d0d3834b62bbbae81e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751647829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Quest is a Semi-Idle RPG game. Players recruit heroes, kill monsters, craft weapons &amp; armor, advance talent trees, enchant/reforge equipment, discover mysterious gems, and finally assemble the most powerful adventure teams!<br><br><strong>Please note before purchase: Idle play is one of the main components of this game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-idle game with deep and complex itemization systems to support endless character builds!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 6 adventurer classes to choose from. Every class has 2 specializations, with 3 spells each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Real-Time battle system: During battles, each unit takes its turn according to its initiative stat. However, triggered effects, buff/debuff ticks, and regeneration happen in &quot;real time&quot;. This unique system allows for deep strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 different active and passive skills to experiment with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant, Reforge, and Transfer systems allow high customization of adventurers\u2019 equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep gem system and a variety of set bonuses to further expand your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of monsters among 6 different maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract residents and conduct explorations to further expand your town!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lunarade O\u00dc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/f2cf9bb1ddba46140f44ef9ab472caf597d65952/header.jpg?t=1751647829","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2330930/1135592235/88372f77112ac08cb615a3711acb2a057b229ba7/1750907468/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746891894","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2330930/1135592235/88372f77112ac08cb615a3711acb2a057b229ba7/1750907468/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746891894","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2330930/1135592235/88372f77112ac08cb615a3711acb2a057b229ba7/1750907468/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746891894","id":257048002,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257048002/movie480.mp4?t=1746891894","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257048002/movie_max.mp4?t=1746891894"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257048002/82dae9bc8b20550ae390140e1107d3510ce765df/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746891894","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257048002/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746891894","max":"https: